{"id":"21f2d14c4c84bf99","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-diagonal-nonacceptance-notation.md","title":"73-df-diagonal-nonacceptance-notation — diagonal nonacceptance notation","display":"73-df-diagonal-nonacceptance-notation — diagonal nonacceptance notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-diagonal-nonacceptance-notation","display":"73-df-diagonal-nonacceptance-notation — diagonal nonacceptance notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]"],"aliases":["73-df-diagonal-nonacceptance-notation","73-definition-8.2"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-diagonal-nonacceptance-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-diagonal-nonacceptance-notation — diagonal nonacceptance notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-diagonal-nonacceptance-notation</span><span>73-definition-8.2</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle M\\rangle=\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\langle M\\rangle=\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\">\\(M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M)\">\\(L(M)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_d\">\\(L_d\\)</span> 保留原文第二个断言与条目主题的“不接受自身编码”含义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.2}\\vdash\nL_d\\coloneqq\\{\\langle M\\rangle:M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\land\\langle M\\rangle\\notin L(M)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.2}\\vdash\nL_d\\coloneqq\\{\\langle M\\rangle:M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\land\\langle M\\rangle\\notin L(M)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>拒绝和发散都属于“不接受”。原第一式把发散、蕴涵和非法码混在一起，且第二式把机器本身当作输入词；现只保留一致且有类型的对角不接受语言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$，$\\langle M\\rangle=\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}$，见 [[73-df-binary-program-coding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}$；$L(M)$ 见 [[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]。$L_d$ 保留原文第二个断言与条目主题的“不接受自身编码”含义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle M\\rangle=\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}","display":false},{"tex":"L(M)","display":false},{"tex":"L_d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.2}\\vdash\nL_d\\coloneqq\\{\\langle M\\rangle:M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\land\\langle M\\rangle\\notin L(M)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1164,"backlinks":[{"id":"220711a8be5be7e0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\mathbf2$；$L_d$ 见 [[73-df-diagonal-nonacceptance-notation]]，词语言类 $\\mathrm{RE}$ 见 [[73-df-enumerable-language-notation]]。"}],"outgoing":["db96cabedd089e5f","888d8ab66ec7efca"]}